{"ID":"20240314091906-00xhh37","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091906-00xhh37","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091906-00xhh37\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165719-6heraeu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165719-en70nrc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165719-en70nrc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:84,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:84\u0026#125;","title":"【黄芩加半夏泻心汤方】（芩加夏姜汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165719-6heraeu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165719-6heraeu","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干呕而利者，黄芩加半夏生姜汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165719-i585spg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165719-i585spg","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩加半夏泻心汤方："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165719-rpqumzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165719-rpqumzw","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩、生姜各三两，甘草二两，芍药一两，半夏半升，大枣十二枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165719-nn9jbnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165719-nn9jbnt","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六位，以水一斗，煮取三升，去渣，温服一升，日再夜一服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165719-0gixbtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165719-0gixbtv","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"干呕而利"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。干呕就是恶心，没有东西呕出来就是干呕。下利，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩加半夏生姜汤主之"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大家看黄芩加半夏生姜汤的处方。第一个，是不是黄连不见了？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个，他有痛，所以会用芍药，所以腹痛的时候一律加白芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大家知道我们这个经方这个原则的时候，处方一开下来就是很对症的哦。因为干呕恶心啊，所以我们要用半夏来止呕，而且是在胃的地方，所以我们要用黄芩，那这个下利的，我们会用生姜啊这些药来把水排掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165719-en70nrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165719-en70nrc","updated":"20240422165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张仲景在伤寒论、金匮里面都强调，当你用处方去治利的时候，到了最终极，你没有办法把他的利止住的时候，你就去利尿。把这水从小便里导出来，否则的话，利一直停不下来，人会虚掉。"}]}]}